[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/1416813518","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/48951#issuecomment-1416813518","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/48951","id":1416813518,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAXExC85UctvO","user":{"login":"crisbeto","id":4450522,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTA1MjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4450522?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto","html_url":"https://github.com/crisbeto","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-04T18:01:34Z","updated_at":"2023-02-04T18:01:34Z","body":"This does seem like a bug in the validation. The problem is that the `cdkContextMenuPosition` isn't actually an input on `CdkContextMenuTrigger`, but rather a property called `menuPosition` that is inherited from `CdkMenuTriggerBase` and exposed through the `inputs` array. Usually the workaround would be to expose `menuPosition`, but that won't work in this case, because it isn't actually marked as an input.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/1416813518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"crisbeto","id":4450522,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTA1MjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4450522?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto","html_url":"https://github.com/crisbeto","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crisbeto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/1416820844","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/48951#issuecomment-1416820844","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/48951","id":1416820844,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAXExC85Ucvhs","user":{"login":"TomTomB","id":12258325,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjU4MzI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12258325?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB","html_url":"https://github.com/TomTomB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-04T18:33:43Z","updated_at":"2023-02-04T18:33:43Z","body":"Mhm, okay. So that's a implementation issue on the CDK side? I think these kinds of inputs / outputs should also be supported by host directives. Even though, this style is not recommended by the Angular Styleguide, it's part of the framework. \r\n\r\nApart from that there's also a kind of weird behavior when exposing the `@Input('cdkContextMenuDisabled')` via host directive. \r\nThat also results in error NG0312. Renaming it fixes the issue.\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nhostDirectives: [\r\n    {\r\n      directive: CdkContextMenuTrigger,\r\n      inputs: [\r\n        'cdkContextMenuDisabled: myDisabled',\r\n      ],\r\n    },\r\n  ],\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/1416820844/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"TomTomB","id":12258325,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjU4MzI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12258325?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB","html_url":"https://github.com/TomTomB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TomTomB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://ap